        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "The library's account model: Account wraps *ecdsa.PrivateKey (accounts.go:34); keys are parsed from hex via gochain crypto.HexToECDSA (accounts.go:24, web3.go:159/262/331) and sender addresses derived with crypto.PubkeyToAddress (Keccak256 of the pubkey; accounts.go:42, web3.go:178/284/354) inside the transaction-sending functions. The curve is secp256k1 — the stdlib ecdsa types carry the key, the curve operations live in gochain/v4. Quantum-unsafe; the key format is dictated by the chain ecosys"
